{"name":"Irish Paddock","hex":"#9ca691","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"paddock","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small enclosure or field of grassland, especially one used to exercise or graze horses or other animals.","An enclosure next to a racecourse where horses are paraded and mounted before a race and unsaddled after a race.\n\n An area at a racing circuit where the racing vehicles are parked and worked on before and between races.\n A field on which a game is played; a playing field.\n A field of grassland of any size, either enclosed by fences or delimited by geographical boundaries, especially a large area for keeping cattle or sheep.\n A place in a superficial deposit where ore or washdirt (“earth rich enough in metal to pay for washing”) is excavated; also, a place for storing ore, washdirt, etc."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To place or keep (cattle, horses, sheep, or other animals) within a paddock (noun sense 1 or 2.4); hence, to provide (such animals) with pasture.","To enclose or fence in (land) to form a paddock."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/paddock"}],"entries":[{"title":"Paddock","blocks":[{"text":"A paddock is a small enclosure for horses. This term also applies to a trackside area for a motor racing competition, particularly Formula One, and is synonymous with the competing field."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Paddock_2006_by-RaBoe.jpg/330px-Paddock_2006_by-RaBoe.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paddock","wikidata":"Q351810"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/True_North_Stakes_horses_in_paddock.jpg/500px-True_North_Stakes_horses_in_paddock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/True_North_Stakes_horses_in_paddock.jpg/1280px-True_North_Stakes_horses_in_paddock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/True_North_Stakes_horses_in_paddock.jpg/500px-True_North_Stakes_horses_in_paddock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The saddling paddock at Belmont Park","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATrue_North_Stakes_horses_in_paddock.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Montana_Expo_Park_Horse_Racing_02.JPG/500px-Montana_Expo_Park_Horse_Racing_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Montana_Expo_Park_Horse_Racing_02.JPG/1280px-Montana_Expo_Park_Horse_Racing_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Montana_Expo_Park_Horse_Racing_02.JPG/500px-Montana_Expo_Park_Horse_Racing_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A saddling paddock at a racetrack","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMontana_Expo_Park_Horse_Racing_02.JPG"}],"sounds":{"paddock":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-paddock.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3d/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-paddock.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-paddock.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3d/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-paddock.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-paddock.wav.ogg"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/En-au-paddock.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm